        "node_id": "n_5_4b8518",
        "thought_text": "The error in the code is due to an incorrect calculation of the total distance. The function should add the result of calculate_distance to total_distance, but it's not doing so. Additionally, the print statement is missing, which is why the function doesn't produce any output. These issues need to be addressed to produce the correct result.",
